BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Knit & Crochet
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260716T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260716T150000
UID:698f7cbe6724c63d00f29033@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join other knitters and crocheters for our knitting and croche
 t circle! Exchange knitting and crochet tips and tricks. Bring your projec
 ts\, troubleshoot patterns\, or work on that piece you have wanted to try.
  All skill levels welcome. Please bring your own supplies.\nDrop-in every 
 Thursday afternoon.
LOCATION:Kennedy/Eglinton\, Meeting Room 2
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/698f7cbe6724c63d00f29033
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
