BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:North York Central Library Film Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260624T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260624T161500
UID:6a0217ee43b41b3d0065b7e5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Please join us for an afternoon screening of "The Great Escape
 r".\nThe Great Escaper (2023)\nRunning time: 97 minutes\nDirector: Oliver 
 Parker\nStarring: Michael Caine and Glenda Jackson\nThis film tells the tr
 ue story of Bernard Jordan\, who made global headlines in the summer of 20
 14. He had staged a “great escape” from his care home to join fellow w
 ar veterans on a beach in Normandy\, commemorating their fallen comrades a
 t the D-Day Landings 70th anniversary.\nThe North York Central Library Fil
 m Club meets monthly on Wednesdays. There is a short\, informal discussion
  after the screening\, time permitting.\nRegistration is not required. Ple
 ase contact the Browsery Department at 416-395-5672 for more information.\
 nNext dates:\nJuly 9 (\nThursday\n\, at 2 PM): F1\nJuly 22 (Wednesday\,\na
 t 6 PM\n-\nSpecial Movie Night\n): Black Bag\nAugust 19 (Wednesday\, at 2 
 PM): TBA
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Auditorium\, 2nd Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a0217ee43b41b3d0065b7e5
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
