DESCRIPTION:The story of a family and family business. Wealthy businessman
  Zsa-zsa Korda (Benicio Del Toro) appoints his only daughter\, a nun as hi
 s sole heir\, to his estate. As Korda embarks on a new enterprise\, they s
 oon become the target of scheming tycoons\, foreign terrorists and determi
 ned assassins\nPG 13\, 101 minutes\n**Subtitles for the Deaf and Hard of H
 earing (SDH) when available.
