BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bone Health 101
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260629T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260629T150000
UID:69dd0701129f127438383882@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:June is Seniors Month!\nAt least 1 in 3 w​​omen and 1 in 5
  men will suffer from a fragility fracture in their lifetime. Join a volun
 teer facilitator from Osteoporosis Canada and learn how to improve your bo
 ne health\, reduce your risk of osteoporosis and related fractures by expl
 oring the following:\nWhat you need to know about bone health and osteopor
 osis\nThe risk of fracturing a bone\nHow to maintain healthy bones\nImpact
  of nutrition & physical activity\nFall prevention
LOCATION:Richview\, Room A\, 2nd Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69dd0701129f127438383882
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
