UID:69e14c242866a5b488490b3c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy watching DVDs in the Library Auditorium.\nCoffee\, tea a
 nd cookies or snacks will be served after the film.  Ingredient lists will
  be available upon request.\nBig Bang\nScientists explore the birth of the
  universe\, from the Big Bang through the cosmic “Dark Ages\,” using s
 tunning space-telescope imagery to reveal how the first galaxies and stars
  formed. Scientists also investigate what may have happened in the tiniest
  fraction of a second after the universe began\, bringing us closer than e
 ver to understanding our cosmic origins. Closed Captions. 55 minutes.2021
