BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Finding Recovery Through Exercise Skills and Hope (FRESH): Movies 
 Saturdays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260905T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260905T163000
UID:6931f2a276261f28005d7d62@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This program helps people stay active\, make friends\, learn n
 ew skills\, and have fun. Meet new folks\, build connections\, and tell us
  about programs and services you would like to see in the neighbourhood!\n
 Come and join the F.R.E.S.H. group for a Saturday screening of popular mov
 ies.\nWe'll be playing the following films\nJune 6\nth\n– A River Runs T
 hrough It\nJune 13\nth\n– Planes\, Trains and Automobiles\nJune 20\nth\n
 – The Grapes of Wrath (1940)\nJune 27\nth\n–\nWalk the Line\nDrop in\,
  no registration is required.\nSnacks and refreshments are provided for al
 l participants. Ingredient lists will be available at the program.\nThis p
 rogram is in collaboration with\nGerstein Crisis Centre's F.R.E.S.H. initi
 ative\n.
LOCATION:Toronto Reference Library\, First floor\, Activity Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6931f2a276261f28005d7d62
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
