UID:69e1437b2866a5b488490694@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy watching DVDs in the Library Auditorium.\nCoffee\, tea a
 nd cookies or snacks will be served after the film. Ingredient lists will 
 be available upon request.\nGrowing up Canadian: Family\nCanadians of all 
 ages share stories of growing up with parents\, siblings\, and even family
  pets during a time when most families struggled to get by. Set against Ca
 nada’s shift from rural to urban life\, the film traces how homes\, cars
 \, and neighbourhoods changed through the first half of the 20th century.4
 5 minutes. 2003
