  one of the TPL Reading Challenge categories.\nThis month we will be discu
 ssing\nI Shall Be Near to You\nBy Erin Lindsay McCabe\nCategory Is –Char
 acter in Disguise\nAn extraordinary novel about a strong-willed woman who 
 disguises herself as a man in order to fight beside her husband in the Civ
 il War\, inspired by a real female soldier's letters home.\nInformation Co
 llection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by th
 e Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\,
  20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and progra
 m registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library 
