UID:69e25b5d5c04bc0fc062a241@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Participants will be guided through a series of short responsi
 ve art exercises\, such as blackout poetry\, collage\, blind drawing\, etc
 . Through strategies that result in abstract visual responses\, we will br
 eak down expectations of how an experience can be shared and art is made. 
 These activities are excellent ways to prevent overthinking outcomes and f
 ocus on the experience of creation.\nLed by Jennifer Long and Ursula Handl
 eigh
