SUMMARY:Senior Club: Creative Soap Making for Older Adults & Seniors
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260619T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260619T153000
UID:69f61204deee9abd8ee9a9da@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:June is Seniors Month\n– a time to celebrate and recognize t
 he invaluable contributions of older adults across the province\, and to p
 romote vibrant\, age-friendly communities. In honor of Seniors Month\, joi
 n us for a\nfun\, hands-on soap-making workshop\nwhere you will learn how 
 to design your soap. No experience needed — perfect for beginners and DI
 Y enthusiasts alike.\nAll supplies provided no experience required. Regist
 er opens for seniors on May 15 at 3:30PM.
LOCATION:Steeles
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69f61204deee9abd8ee9a9da
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
