BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Law and Older Adults
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260630T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260630T143000
UID:6a11e2898ea300e2631807e4@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:It's Seniors Month! Join lawyer Jack Fallon to learn about th
 e rights and responsibilities of older adults under Ontario Law. Navigatin
 g the legal system is tough. This program is designed to help deepen your 
 understanding of the rights and responsibilities of older adults and those
  who care for them under Ontario law. This program will cover capacity\, t
 he importance of power of attorney\, remedies for financial abuse of senio
 rs and more. Presented in collaboration with the\nOntario Bar Association\
 n.
LOCATION:Agincourt\, Main Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a11e2898ea300e2631807e4
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
