UID:69f8ab4ce7108c0f03d0db65@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:June is Seniors Month in Ontario! Embrace lifelong learning by
  trying out a beginner-friendly acrylic painting class. No experience is n
 ecessary—just a willingness to have fun and try something new.\nThis pro
 gram is presented by Domenica Gaudio\, who will guide you step-by-step thr
 ough a simple project. You'll learn the basics of color mixing\, brush tec
 hniques\, and composition\, while creating your own beautiful artwork to t
 ake home.\nAll materials—including paints\, brushes\, canvases\, and apr
 ons—will be provided. Just bring your creativity and a smile!\nDrop-in\,
  no registration required. All adults welcome. Program will be capped at 
 the first 15 participants.
