DESCRIPTION:In this class\, participants will be introduced to the world o
 f art and creative storytelling through movement and music. These activiti
 es have been proven to improve circulation and joint mobility\, promote me
 ntal stimulation\, improve posture and coordination\, and build strength a
 nd balance. No previous movement experience is required.\nIn celebration o
 f Seniors Month!\nA limited number of spaces will be reserved for drop-ins
 .\nMoving Stories is brought to you by tiger princess dance projects.\nMov
 ing Stories is generously supported by the Canada Council for the Arts\, 
 Ontario Arts Council & Toronto Arts Council.\nInformation Collection Notic
