DESCRIPTION:An introductory class on Microsoft Excel for absolute beginner
 s with little or no Excel experience.\nIn this first session\, you will:\n
 Learn the basic function and      design of Excel files\nPractice basic da
 ta entry for      text\, numbers\, and basic functions: Sum\, AutoSum and 
 Average\nCreate and save your first      workbook and worksheets\nUpon com
 pletion of this class\, you will be able to use Excel at a basic level.\nP
 rerequisites: Basic mouse and keyboard skills are required.\nFormat: Hands
