DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260625T190000
UID:69f227b5b6c4ac1fedcf9abd@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us in-person to have great book club discussions each mon
 th! June's book is Everything I Never Told You  by Celeste Ng. Pick up y
 our book at the front desk! Registration is required and copies are limite
 d. Please place a copy of the book on hold if our branch does not have an 
 available copy.\nForest Hill will have limited copies of the month's title
  6 weeks prior to the date of the book club.\nUpcoming Books:\nJune 25:\n
 Everything I never told you about\nJuly/August: Break\nSeptember 24:\nBro
 ken Country\nOctober 29:\nLost Lady\nNovember 26:\nCrook Manifesto
LOCATION:Forest Hill\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69f227b5b6c4ac1fedcf9abd
