BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fire Safety & Fall Prevention for Older Adults
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260623T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260623T140000
UID:69f20eb0bd9a3c316a562ef7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an informative program designed to help older adul
 ts stay safe at home. Delivered in partnership with Toronto Fire Services\
 , this session focuses on essential fire safety and fall‑prevention prac
 tices to support independent living. Participants will learn about the pr
 oper placement of smoke and carbon monoxide alarms\, fire safety in high
 ‑rise buildings\, common causes of home fires\, escape planning for indi
 viduals with special needs\, and how to call for help in an emergency.
LOCATION:Agincourt\, Main Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69f20eb0bd9a3c316a562ef7
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Senior's Club - Birding 101 – Tips for Bird Watching in Toronto
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260623T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260623T150000
UID:69f292672866a5b4884bb323@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Cliffcrest invites all to our Seniors Club! Hang out and enjoy
  games\, engaging presentations and workshops on a variety of topics. Exce
 pt for June Seniors Club meets on the 3rd week of every month.\nThis Mont
 h: Birding 101 – Tips for Bird Watching in Toronto\nJune is Seniors Mont
 h in Ontario! Embrace lifelong learning by learning about Birding! Birding
  is fun\, easy\, and can be done anywhere - in your own backyard\, or in a
  local park. Learn everything you need to know to get started\, from choos
 ing binoculars and field guides\, to where and when to bird in your neighb
 ourhood\, and what birds you are likely to find in the city. Find out abou
 t clubs and field trips\, birding ethics\, and protection and conservation
  efforts. Presented by Monika Croydon\, ​a member of the Toronto Ornitho
 logical Club.
LOCATION:Cliffcrest
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69f292672866a5b4884bb323
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
