BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Computers for Beginners 3: Use the Internet
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260619T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260619T193000
UID:6a10a2df8ea300e26317d26a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:An introductory class on the Internet for absolute beginners w
 ith little computer experience.\nIn this third session you will:\nUndersta
 nd how to read a web site address\nPractice using web addresses\nSearch fo
 r information using a search engine\nExplore a web site in detail to under
 stand its key components\nUpon completion of this class students will be a
 ble to use the internet at a beginner level and complete simple searches.\
 nPrerequisites: Computer for Beginners 1 & 2 or basic mouse and keyboardin
 g skills\nFormat: Hands-on with demonstrations
LOCATION:Black Creek
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a10a2df8ea300e26317d26a
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Computers for Beginners 4: Use Google Search and Maps
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260626T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260626T193000
UID:6a10a33d43b41b3d00686971@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:A class on using Google's filters\, tools\, and Maps for absol
 ute beginners with little computer experience.\nIn this fourth session you
  will:\nUse Google search tools more effectively to find websites\, images
 \, and news sites\nExplore Google Maps to find addresses and get direction
 s for transit and road travel.\nUpon completion of this class students wil
 l be able to use more advanced search engine features and use Google Maps 
 at a basic level.\nPrerequisites: Computers for Beginners 1\, 2 & 3 or bas
 ic mouse\, keyboarding and internet skills\nFormat: Hands-on with demonstr
 ations
LOCATION:Black Creek
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a10a33d43b41b3d00686971
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
