 r an afternoon of painting to discover the joy of artistic expression! Thi
 s workshop will introduce participants to watercolor painting while develo
 ping new skills\, building confidence and learning to engage in art-makin
 g as a form of relaxation\, mindfulness and personal enjoyment!\nNo prior 
